      "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/2e10cab906a714be037c570c8b2e428c.poster.avif?t=1718723851\" width=598 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/2e10cab906a714be037c570c8b2e428c.webm?t=1718723851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/2e10cab906a714be037c570c8b2e428c.mp4?t=1718723851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>EPILEPSY WARNING</i><br><br><i>Step into the world of Loathful, a first-person Psychological Horror game that immerses you in a vintage, retro-style universe featuring PS1 graphics. Where, What was meant to be an escape turns into a relentless nightmare. </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/b62f66600915af5ef393a137b244b599.poster.avif?t=1718723851\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/b62f66600915af5ef393a137b244b599.webm?t=1718723851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/b62f66600915af5ef393a137b244b599.mp4?t=1718723851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main characteristics:</h2><br>Step into the shoes of a young employee at 'Neural Net Solutions,' a cutting-edge technology enterprise on the forefront of innovation. They've offered you a unique opportunity to test their groundbreaking technology, allowing you to upload your mind into the cloud, whether temporarily or for eternity.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a world filled with subtle mechanics and intricate puzzles, where your primary objective is to explore an unfamiliar realm that constantly push you to your limits.<br><br>Inspired by beloved games of the same genre, 'Loathful' distinguishes itself with its retro design and straightforward yet highly effective gameplay<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/daa1d9b1f5c3ca467860db6670524893.poster.avif?t=1718723851\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/daa1d9b1f5c3ca467860db6670524893.webm?t=1718723851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/daa1d9b1f5c3ca467860db6670524893.mp4?t=1718723851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A bone-chilling experience where you are the vulnerable one, hunted by everything and everyone around you<br></li><li>Explore five distinct worlds set in a ever-changing virtual reality vacation resort<br></li><li>Encounter a variety of enemy types, each with unique mechanics to keep you on your toes<br></li><li>Immersive first-person gameplay with a retro feel<br></li><li>Solve various intricate puzzles and riddles<br></li><li>In-depth story which expands upon itself with videos and documents.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/6bc2651defae9448456b600af4d308b1.avif?t=1718723851\" width=500 height=500 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A̴͔͂̂̀̽̒̉̿͂̾n̴͕̘̗͈̩̹̮̪̫͌͗͋̑ ̶̟͈̻͐͛̽̅̇̑̕e̸̖̮̩̪͍͗͐̆̓͛̚x̶͎̞̭̤͍̬̹͎̜͂͗̃͑̏p̴̡̗̫͕̤̅̒͆͑̈̄̅́̉ͅê̷̙̻̲͕̠̫̈͜ŗ̴̛͓̱̟̤͍͋̌̈́͗̋̐͠í̶̮̘̤̘̰̭͙̬e̶̩͎̹̝͍͇̰̭̊̏̏̚͜n̵͔̞͉͈̎̅̏̌͆̎̕c̵̙̘̟͕̱͑͋͊̒é̴͍͍̹̪̏́́ ̸̱̌̅͑̽̾̓͒̚͜y̵̢̧̘̝̫̐̈́̒̓̈́̀͛͊͜o̴̢̦̙̗̤̖̱̤̼͎̎̎̄́͌̕̚͝ȗ̶̪̟̈̇̓͝ ̷̠̞̬̦̜́̑̄͛͜͝͝ẁ̶͉i̶̖̼̮̿̀͆͗̊̈́͑͐l̷̦̗̠̊͛̌͊͋̈́̔̚͝ḷ̸̢̛̞̤̳̙̖͓̤̈́̔̋͗́̇̀͂ ̵͓̫̈̉̔̎̉͘͝