ry objective is to explore an unfamiliar realm that constantly push you to your limits.<br><br>Inspired by beloved games of the same genre, 'Loathful' distinguishes itself with its retro design and straightforward yet highly effective gameplay<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/daa1d9b1f5c3ca467860db6670524893.poster.avif?t=1718723851\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/daa1d9b1f5c3ca467860db6670524893.webm?t=1718723851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/daa1d9b1f5c3ca467860db6670524893.mp4?t=1718723851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A bone-chilling experience where you are the vulnerable one, hunted by everything and everyone around you<br></li><li>Explore five distinct worlds set in a ever-changing virtual reality vacation resort<br></li><li>Encounter a variety of enemy types, each with unique mechanics to keep you on your toes<br></li><li>Immersive first-person gameplay with a retro feel<br></li><li>Solve various intricate puzzles and riddles<br></li><li>In-depth story which expands upon itself with videos and documents.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950200/extras/6bc2651defae9448456b600af4d308b1.avif?t=1718723851\" width=500 height=500 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A̴͔͂̂̀̽̒̉̿͂̾n̴͕̘̗͈̩̹̮̪̫͌͗͋̑ ̶̟͈̻͐͛̽̅̇̑̕e̸̖̮̩̪͍͗͐̆̓͛̚x̶͎̞̭̤͍̬̹͎̜͂͗̃͑̏p̴̡̗̫͕̤̅̒͆͑̈̄̅́̉ͅê̷̙̻̲͕̠̫̈͜ŗ̴̛͓̱̟̤͍͋̌̈́͗̋̐͠í̶̮̘̤̘̰̭͙̬e̶̩͎̹̝͍͇̰̭̊̏̏̚͜n̵͔̞͉͈̎̅̏̌͆̎̕c̵̙̘̟͕̱͑͋͊̒é̴͍͍̹̪̏́́ ̸̱̌̅͑̽̾̓͒̚͜y̵̢̧̘̝̫̐̈́̒̓̈́̀͛͊͜o̴̢̦̙̗̤̖̱̤̼͎̎̎̄́͌̕̚͝ȗ̶̪̟̈̇̓͝ ̷̠̞̬̦̜́̑̄͛͜͝͝ẁ̶͉i̶̖̼̮̿̀͆͗̊̈́͑͐l̷̦̗̠̊͛̌͊͋̈́̔̚͝ḷ̸̢̛̞̤̳̙̖͓̤̈́̔̋͗́̇̀͂ ̵̢͓̫̥̈̉̔̎̉͘͜͜͝n̷